# Copy to `.env` (gitignored). Never commit real credentials.
# Postgres used by `wrangler dev` (Hyperdrive binding `PG`) and by src/lib/auth.ts locally.
# Point this at the Neon DEV database, not Supabase prod. Use sslmode=require.
CLOUDFLARE_HYPERDRIVE_LOCAL_CONNECTION_STRING_PG=postgres://USER:PASSWORD@HOST.neon.tech/DBNAME?sslmode=require
